  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a nonstick skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add diced onion and bell pepper, sauté until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Stir in ground almonds and cumin, cooking until the almonds lightly toast for 1 minute.",
    "Pour in canned tomatoes, season with salt, pepper, and oregano, and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Add bonito shavings and stir well, then cover and let the mixture thicken for another 3 minutes.",
    "Remove from heat, fluff the mixture with a fork, and sprinkle chopped parsley on top.",
